      "snippet": {
        "line": 122,
        "text": "def averagedPressureDifferenceValue (W0 W1 : Space -> R) (G : Fin 3 -> Fin 3 -> Space -> R) (k : Fin 3) (psi : ComplexTest) : C := (int x, W0 x * laplacianCLM psi x) + (int x, W1 x * psi x) + (sum i, int x, G k i x * partialCLM i psi x) + sum i, sum j, pressurePair i j (G i j) (partialCLM k psi)"
